# Rust build artifacts
**/target
**/Cargo.lock.bak

# Lake build cache
**/.lake

# Scratch / OS
/tmp
.DS_Store

# Per-worktree workstream trail file (see CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md). One
# active stream = one local STATUS.md at its root; never committed.
/STATUS.md

# Agent workstream index and plans (see CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md). Working
# notes for whoever is driving a stream, not a project artifact: they go
# stale against the tree, and a stale plan read as current is worse than
# no plan. Kept local, one copy in the base dir; never committed.
docs/ai/

# Local-dev convenience symlink (see CLAUDE.md). Points outside the repo;
# do not commit.
.claude/

# Git worktrees for isolated agent work.
.worktrees/

# Proof-tree visualizer regenerable artifact (1+ MB; rebuild with
# `lake exe trust-gate print-tree-edges <root>`).
trust/proof-tree/edges.tsv

.playwright-mcp

# Build artifacts produced by `nix run .#populate` — sail-lean tree,
# pilout, and the auto-generated PIL2 extraction under
# build/extraction/Extraction/. Reproducible from the flake — never
# commit. The hand-written extraction-layer files (ArithTable.lean,
# MemoryBuses.lean, OperationBuses.lean) live tracked under
# ZiskFv/Extraction/.
/build/

# Nix flake build outputs (symlinks)
/result
/result-*

# Cachix auth tokens (write-scoped, must never be committed)
/.zisk-rw-token
/.cachix-token
/*.cachix-token

# Legacy leftover from the deleted docker pipeline (root-owned, harmless)
/out/

.rgignore

